00:01:57.992 --> 00:01:58.825
Okay. Okay.

00:01:58.825 --> 00:01:59.800
Raja, how about you?

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:00.957
Look at, look at what's hap-
(Raja laughing)

00:02:00.957 --> 00:02:03.111
I love what's happening, like, okay.

00:02:03.111 --> 00:02:04.736
So how did you come up with your name?

00:02:04.736 --> 00:02:07.537
- I'm Raja, and I got my name, actually,

00:02:07.537 --> 00:02:09.942
because I'm Indonesian, and in Indonesian,

00:02:09.942 --> 00:02:11.802
Raja actually means king.

00:02:11.802 --> 00:02:12.635
- [Kelly] Ooh!

00:02:12.635 --> 00:02:13.468
- And also at the time,

00:02:13.468 --> 00:02:14.662
